ath d="M19.98 10.023c0 .2-.058.399-.168.547l-4.996 7.492a.987.987 0 01-.828.454h-3c-.547 0-.996-.453-.996-1 0-.2.059-.403.168-.551l4.625-6.942-4.625-6.945a.939.939 0 01-.168-.55 1 1 0 01.996-.997h3c.348 0 .649.18.828.45l4.996 7.492c.11.148.168.347.168.55zm0 0"></path></g></svg></button></div></div></aside><main class="docMainContainer_EfwR"><div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class="row"><div class="col docItemCol_n6xZ"><div class="docItemContainer_RhpI"><article><nav class="theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_Wvrh" aria-label="Breadcrumbs"><ul class="breadcrumbs"><li class="breadcrumbs__item"><a aria-label="Home page" class="breadcrumbs__link" href="/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="breadcrumbHomeIcon_uaSn"><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a></li><li class="breadcrumbs__item"><a class="breadcrumbs__link" href="/tests/docs/category/tests"><span>Tests</span></a></li><li class="breadcrumbs__item"><span class="breadcrumbs__link">links</span></li><li class="breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active"><span class="breadcrumbs__link">Test links</span></li></ul></nav><div class="tocCollapsible_BEWm theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_NSfz"><button type="button" class="clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_IbtT">On this page</button></div><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown"><header><h1>Test links</h1></header>{"\n"}<p>These are dogfood tests showing that Markdown links with md/mdx file references are resolved correctly.</p>{"\n"}<p>Also proves that <a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/issues/9048" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#9048</a> linking bugs are solved.</p>{"\n"}<hr />{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="resolvable-links">Resolvable links<a href="#resolvable-links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Resolvable links" title="Direct link to Resolvable links" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">target.mdx</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">./target.mdx</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">../links/target.mdx</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug?age=42#target-heading">./target.mdx?age=42#target-heading</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug?qs=value%20with%20space">&lt;./target.mdx?qs=value with space&gt;</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a title="link title" class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">target.mdx 'link title'</a></p>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="complex-resolvable-links">Complex resolvable links<a href="#complex-resolvable-links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Complex resolvable links" title="Direct link to Complex resolvable links" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>Some of those are edge cases reported in <a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/issues/9048" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#9048</a></p>{"\n"}<p><code>inline triple backticks code block, see https:&#47;/github.com/facebook/docusaurus/issues/9048#issuecomment-1959199829</code></p>{"\n"}<p><b><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">./target.mdx</a> bolded</b></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug"><strong>./target.mdx</strong> with <em>italic</em> and <span style="color:red"><code>JSX</code></span></a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug#target-heading"><code>Type1</code></a>&lt;<a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug#target-heading"><code>Type2</code></a>&gt;</p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">{"./target.mdx link\ndeclared\non\nmultiple\nlines\n"}</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Image with ./target.mdx link" src="/assets/images/slash-introducing-bb22254856e7d15e.svg" width="760" height="160" class="img_vXGZ" /></a></p>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="unresolvable-links">Unresolvable links<a href="#unresolvable-links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Unresolvable links" title="Direct link to Unresolvable links" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/blob/main/README.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https:&#47;/github.com/facebook/docusaurus/blob/main/README.md</a></p>{"\n"}<p><a href="ftp:///README.mdx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">ftp:&#47;&#47;/README.mdx</a></p>{"\n"}<div class="language-markdown codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-markdown codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);">[</span><span class="token url content" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);">target.mdx</span><span class="token url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);">](</span><span class="token url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);">target.mdx</span><span class="token url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);">)</span><br /></div></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup_KXnS"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_gMWc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_GXfb"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_ktUX"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="links-in-comments">Links in comments<a href="#links-in-comments" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Links in comments" title="Direct link to Links in comments" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>MDX/HTML comments with invalid file references should not be resolved nor reported by the broken link checker:</p>{"\n"}<div class="language-mdx codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-mdx codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">&#123;&#47;* [doesNotExist.mdx](doesNotExist.mdx) */&#125;</span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain" style="display: inline-block;"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">&lt;!-- [doesNotExist.mdx](doesNotExist.mdx) --&gt;</span><br /></div></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup_KXnS"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_gMWc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_GXfb"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_ktUX"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>{"\n\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="reference-style-links">Reference-style links<a href="#reference-style-links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Reference-style links" title="Direct link to Reference-style links" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>The following should also work:</p>{"\n"}<div class="language-md codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-md codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">Testing some link refs: [link-ref1], [link-ref2], [link-ref3]</span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain" style="display: inline-block;"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token url-reference url variable" style="color: rgb(227, 98, 9);">link-ref1</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">]</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">:</span><span class="token url-reference url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);"> target.mdx</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token url-reference url variable" style="color: rgb(227, 98, 9);">link-ref2</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">]</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">:</span><span class="token url-reference url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);"> ./target.mdx</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token url-reference url variable" style="color: rgb(227, 98, 9);">link-ref3</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">]</span><span class="token url-reference url punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">:</span><span class="token url-reference url" style="color: rgb(54, 172, 170);"> ../links/target.mdx?qs#target-heading</span><br /></div></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup_KXnS"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_gMWc" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_GXfb"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_ktUX"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>{"\n"}<p>Testing some link refs: <a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">link-ref1</a>, <a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug">link-ref2</a>, <a class="" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug?qs#target-heading">link-ref3</a></p></div><footer class="theme-doc-footer docusaurus-mt-lg"><div class="row margin-top--sm theme-doc-footer-edit-meta-row"><div class="col noPrint_ZWEb"><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/edit/main/website/_dogfooding/_docs tests/tests/links/test-markdown-links.mdx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="theme-edit-this-page"><svg fill="currentColor" height="20" width="20" viewBox="0 0 40 40" class="iconEdit_IMw_" aria-hidden="true"><g><path d="m34.5 11.7l-3 3.1-6.3-6.3 3.1-3q0.5-0.5 1.2-0.5t1.1 0.5l3.9 3.9q0.5 0.4 0.5 1.1t-0.5 1.2z m-29.5 17.1l18.4-18.5 6.3 6.3-18.4 18.4h-6.3v-6.2z"></path></g></svg>Edit this page</a></div><div class="col lastUpdated_OHCJ"><span class="theme-last-updated">Last updated on <b><time datetime="2026-10-16T21:18:25.000Z" itemprop="dateModified">Oct 16, 2026</time></b> by <b>Sébastien Lorber</b></span></div></div></footer></article><nav class="docusaurus-mt-lg pagination-nav" aria-label="Docs pages"><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--prev" href="/tests/docs/tests/links/target-doc-slug"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">Previous</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">Target doc</div></a><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next" href="/tests/docs/tests/sidebar-frontmatter"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">Next</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">Sidebar Front Matter Tests</div></a></nav></div></div><div class="col col--3"><div class="tableOfContents_RLlU thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop"><ul class="table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border"><li><a href="#resolvable-links" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Resolvable links</a></li><li><a href="#complex-resolvable-links" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Complex resolvable links</a></li><li><a href="#unresolvable-links" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Unresolvable links</a></li><li><a href="#links-in-comments" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Links in comments</a></li><li><a href="#reference-style-links" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Reference-style links</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main></div></div></div><Footer /></div>
